{"id":"WTIyEmzLR_mlw__SXY_iwA==","name":"Inserting Fluids","description":"Sometimes you insert fluid in the system. You need something to get the fluid into the correct buffer other than inserting the fluid into the buffer manually.\n\nThere are 2 pipes that can do the job: transfer fluid into a tank connected to a fluid basic pipe allocated to said fluid.\n\n1. Logistics Fluid Extractor Pipe. It extracts fluid from connected buffer to the correct big storage tank. It doesn't require a pump but it is slower.\n\n2. Logistics Fluid Insertion Pipe. It does not pull fluids from tanks actively, requiring a GT pump if you are using GT tanks, but it can send fluids faster.\n\nTake a pick :)","icon":{"Count":1,"Damage":0,"OreDict":"","id":"LogisticsPipes:item.PipeFluidExtractor","resolved":{"id":"i:LogisticsPipes:item.PipeFluidExtractor:0","name":"Logistics Fluid Extractor Pipe","mod":"LogisticsPipes","registry":"item.PipeFluidExtractor","icon":8772,"nbt":null,"kind":"item","unit":"items","damage":0,"shard":"5c2bd62856a35401","recipes":1},"label":"Logistics Fluid Extractor Pipe"},"prerequisites":["7O4n10fJSxme0Bs0_n44xg=="],"tasks":{"0":{"autoConsume":0,"consume":0,"groupDetect":0,"ignoreNBT":1,"index":0,"partialMatch":1,"requireOnlyOneItem":1,"requiredItems":{"0":{"Count":1,"Damage":0,"OreDict":"","id":"LogisticsPipes:item.PipeFluidExtractor","resolved":{"id":"i:LogisticsPipes:item.PipeFluidExtractor:0","name":"Logistics Fluid Extractor Pipe","mod":"LogisticsPipes","registry":"item.PipeFluidExtractor","icon":8772,"nbt":null,"kind":"item","unit":"items","damage":0,"shard":"5c2bd62856a35401","recipes":1},"label":"Logistics Fluid Extractor Pipe"},"1":{"Count":1,"Damage":0,"OreDict":"","id":"LogisticsPipes:item.PipeFluidInsertion","resolved":{"id":"i:LogisticsPipes:item.PipeFluidInsertion:0","name":"Logistics Fluid Insertion Pipe","mod":"LogisticsPipes","registry":"item.PipeFluidInsertion","icon":8773,"nbt":null,"kind":"item","unit":"items","damage":0,"shard":"45885c54f78b20a9